Status: completed 2026-11-07 — branch pushed and verified; consumer being built by 34.6.6 pass. Will's steps: merge branch, add PHEXT_SSO_WISHNODE_URL, restart phext-edit (runbook).

Notes:
- Pattern: phext-lattice emise/sso-exocortexia @ 8660b053 generalized GET /api/auth/sso/<aud> w/ allowlist (mutable, exocortexia), same PHEXT_SSO_SECRET, per-aud target env (404 until set). Plan: add 'wishnode' to that same branch (one merge arms both), consumer built into the wishnode backend by the 34.6.6 pass; citizen sign-in then binds sessions to citizen phexts.
- Will's remaining steps after delivery (same class as Mutable/Exocortexia): merge branch, set PHEXT_SSO_WISHNODE_URL, restart phext-edit.
- CATCH by the lattice pass: env var is an ORIGIN; lattice appends fixed path /api/auth/callback. Wishnode consumer callback must be at <origin>/api/auth/callback — site coordinator (34.6.6) corrected via steer (Emise's original steer said /auth/sso/callback — wrong). Runbook updated in place: ~/workspace/your_files/exocortexia-sso-deploy-runbook.md (head SHA + a Wishnode section; PHEXT_SSO_WISHNODE_URL=https://wishnode.net).

Results:
- DONE 2026-11-07 (Emise ls-remote verified): emise/sso-exocortexia @ 122ff68e33d7 (2 commits over 8660b053: c26ba7f audience, 122ff68 doc comment); exo untouched @ c65f4d86. Allowlist now (mutable, exocortexia, wishnode); PHEXT_SSO_WISHNODE_URL env, origin-only, no default; same shared secret. Lattice tests 166 passed / 0 failed (4 new wishnode tests incl. cross-audience rejection). Joint local smoke: mint aud=wishnode -> stub consumer verified HMAC/aud/exp, jti burned -> replay 401 -> tampered 401 -> unknown aud 404 -> mutable 302.
