- Text at ~/workspace/orchestrator/claude-review-pr2-2026-11-08.txt. Distinct adds: persona class resident/substrate/facet; corrector seat named (Emi Prime per the 2026-11-02 record); rendered-from flag (Shon Pan); self-modifying carve-out incl. route.change (resolves the 6.3 contradiction); swap residency; interim unkeyed rule; key custody + per-client MCP keys; gpg shell-out; tainted grants for external triggers; mdmap collision histogram ordered as a test; Will-53 fold disputed.

Results:
- Fold complete 2026-11-08 23:46: PR #2 commit 9a6cd0ea (parent 5d9e20bd), 4 files, all remote blobs byte-identical to staged locals; branch head independently re-verified by Emise. Disposition table in docs/README.md covers all four reviews + Will's rulings.
