# Seed charon: README + Prompt 0 for Copilot

Coordinate: 22.5.7/6.6.12/8.5.6
Issued: 2026-11-09 10:58 CST
Request (from session record): Seed charon: draft README + Prompt 0 for Copilot. Checked into wbic16/charon at Will's direction ('check the seed into the repo, we'll build it here'). Charon is the streamlined work-usable qexo variant for EFJ developers: Helix ALM + Jira + GitHub Copilot + Gitea MCP + team tracker in one CLI, API access, GPG; no persona transfer.
Status: complete — seed checked into wbic16/charon@main

Notes:
- Repo verified public and empty 2026-11-09 (no branches) before seeding.
- Git Data API cannot create blobs in a completely empty repo (409); seeded via Contents API PUT instead — two commits on main.
- Repo description PATCH returned 403 (token lacks Administration permission); Will can set the description in the GitHub UI if wanted.

Results:
- README.md on wbic16/charon@main — blob 6a94eae28ea6809c8db2a179de47563d5b3c06e6, matches local git hash-object exactly.
- prompts/00-spec.md on wbic16/charon@main — blob aaa7a66734f56a05c652b9f39699a803e8ef1350, matches local exactly.
- Artifacts inscribed in artifacts.phext (README 32.6.8/8.6.11/6.5.9; Prompt 0 34.6.7/8.6.11/6.5.9), pushed to wbic16/human@exo commit d887b3c1; remote SHA-256 verified identical (d4ba732e…).
