- Coordinate corrected 23:53: the value in the original dispatch brief was written before the coordinate was computed; the tool's computed coordinate for the request is 28.6.8/7.5.9/4.4.7.
- Fold scope grew in the same pass: 23:53 baked corpus (24.6.8/7.6.10/6.6.9) and 23:55 source.phext (33.6.9/8.6.12/6.5.9) added by addenda to the same worker/commit.

