Notes:
- Repo: wbic16/phext-notepad. Branch stack from this chat's work: cursor/native-phext-notepad-ad0b (PR #4's branch) -> emise/perf-sparse-load @ 8a3af359 -> emise/edit-sync @ a9f604e7 -> emise/desktop-sso @ c83778ed; and perf-sparse-load -> emise/ultra-open-fix @ 75789a91. Default branch exo (protected) dormant at 4ffc24cb since 2026-10-24 at last check — worker verifies fresh state incl. all PRs in all states before acting.
- Scope: open the ONE PR Will named (ultra-open-fix; base chosen from the real graph and justified); for every other branch, a review verdict only (distance from base, trial-merge conflict check, existing PR state, recommendation). No rebases performed under this task — Will's rebase rule (force-with-lease, backup branch) engages when he directs a specific rebase.

Results:
