# Phext previewer for Android

Coordinate: 29.9.13/9.8.12/8.7.9
Issued: 2026-11-07
Request (verbatim): i need a phext previewer for Android
Status: complete - Phext Previewer web artifact built and verified (slug phext-previewer)

Notes:
- Format spec from ~/workspace/phext/parse_phext.py: delimiters 0x01 library, 0x1F shelf, 0x1E series, 0x1D collection, 0x1C volume, 0x1A book, 0x19 chapter, 0x18 section, 0x17 scroll; first scroll at 1.1.1/1.1.1/1.1.1.

Results:
- Parser verified byte-for-byte against parse_phext.py on barnacles.phext (793/793 scrolls), emise.phext (129 slots/20 non-empty), agi.phext (353,015 slots/7,240 non-empty) - identical counts and first/last coordinates. Live probe: sample load, Next/Prev, Index, full-text search, Map stats, coordinate jump, per-axis steppers all passed; no console errors, no mobile overflow.
# Fix the 3 exo audit findings — 3 commits, one branch, one PR

Coordinate: 29.10.10/10.10.14/8.8.13
Issued: 2026-11-08 20:39 CST
Request (verbatim): 11. fix the 3 audit findings in 3 commits on one branch, and open a PR
Status: complete 2026-11-08 20:44 — PR #33 open, awaiting Will's merge

Notes:
- Findings from the exo audit (task 29.7.8/8.8.14/13.5.8): (1) container env contract misses PHEXT_SSO_DESKTOP, (2) deploy.sh oauth.env template lags the binary's 20-var contract, (3) phext-edit.service 'step 4b' pointer is stale. One commit per finding, in that order.

Results:
- Branch emise/audit-fixes-2026-11-08 on current exo 7abef5e1 (PR #14 had merged since the audit; ancestry verified). Exactly 3 commits, one per finding: 360d4613 container env contract gains PHEXT_SSO_DESKTOP (env.example + CONTAINER.md; compose.yaml untouched — SSO vars flow via env_file passthrough); ae1bb049 deploy.sh oauth.env template extended to the binary's full contract (X provider added live; claim/SSO vars as commented placeholders; create-only semantics untouched; bash -n clean); 68929e43 phext-edit.service pointer corrected from 'step 4b' to step 4 (the step that creates oauth.env).
- cargo test on tip: 178 passed, 0 failed (175 audit baseline + 3 tests PR #14 added to exo; these commits touch no Rust).
- PR #33 open, non-draft, mergeable, base exo, 4 files +28/-5; remote blobs + tree modes verified after push (deploy.sh stays 100755). Merge is Will's.
