- PR #47 verified from the worker's saved API response (state open, html_url github.com/wbic16/phext-lattice/pull/47) + PH_POST_ID constant present in the built tree. Design: const PH_POST_ID: Option<&str> = None in phext_edit.rs; unset -> static palette pill 'Launching on Product Hunt — Tue Nov 10' linking to the post URL (no img, cannot 404); set -> official badge snippet (api.producthunt.com featured.svg?post_id=&theme=dark, 250x54); non-numeric value falls back safely. Placement: sign-in screen under the MCP callout + About page. Tests: lib 180/0, bin 72/0, 2 new badge tests; one e2e_local latency assertion fails on pristine exo too (environmental, proven). GO-LIVE: set PH_POST_ID = Some("<post id from the live embed snippet>") — NOT launch id 1310786 — rebuild, redeploy; Emise to do this flip as part of launch verification and eyeball the anchor UTM suffix against PH's generated snippet then.
