- Final spec = the approved r3 composition at master quality: lessons layer identical to r3's table, Kepler shear, projection lensing, grain 3.38, OU walk + seed, 169 segments, exclusion at load. Delivery 1920x1080, canvas 3840x2160 with 2x supersampling (Lanczos down), SUBN=3, 15 fps (r3's rate, kept), 2,376 frames, 158.400 s, V10-lineage song handling.
- Section 6 reading stated to Will at dispatch: his 'Dispatch V14 Final' is taken as ruling 6.7 IN with its defaults (one-point exception granted, radial placement 1.30x hull, never labelled) — P3* ships exactly as placed in the three prepasses he approved, still never in frame. Plan defaults hold for 6.1-6.6 and 6.8. If he says otherwise, the safe ending (film ends at last dataset point) is the alternate.
