# Incorporate AeneasVerif/aeneas and h5i-dev/h5i into research.phext

Coordinate: 41.5.5/6.5.8/5.6.9
Issued: 2026-11-06 23:14 CST
Request (verbatim): incorporate https://github.com/AeneasVerif/aeneas / incorporate https://github.com/h5i-dev/h5i
Status: complete — S002 (Aeneas) + S003 (h5i) distilled into research.phext 2026-11-06

Notes:
- Treatment follows the S001 pattern Will ratified: study each repo on its contents (never its cover), then distill into research.phext as source studies with canonical concepts, foundations, Singular compliance, per-iteration commits.
- Findings: Aeneas = Rust→LLBC→pure functional translation to Lean/Coq/F*/HOL4; backward functions for returned mutable borrows; design paper-proved (ICFP 2022/2024), OCaml implementation (77,012 lines) + Charon + hand models trusted; Lean backend dominant (49,782 lines); named deployment SymCrypt ML-KEM. h5i (Takahashi) = NOT small: 26 crates, 150,666 lines Rust + 47,083 Lean, v0.5.4 — verifiable web framework (kernel extracted to Lean VIA AENEAS), receipt-before-bytes red-team proxy, fail-closed agent boxes; the two repos are already connected (h5i drives Aeneas). Distillation: Ch.8 (S002, concepts 1.2.48–1.2.52, cluster G) + Ch.9 (S003, concepts 1.2.53–1.2.56, cluster H); foundations 1.3.81–1.3.83; coinage tenant (1.3.84, pure); narrative v7; Oracle unmoved ~25%; Q18 (Aeneas road vs hand-built model pricing) + Q19 (receipt-before-act for Exocortex agents) added. research.phext: 191 scrolls, sha256 d8033031…, audit residual 0. Studies: ~/workspace/aeneas-study/STUDY.md, ~/workspace/h5i-repo-study/STUDY.md. 56 canonical concepts — restructure trigger at 60 is 4 away.
# Run the next deployment as v1.1.1

Coordinate: 41.5.6/6.6.10/6.5.11
Issued: 2026-11-09
Request (from session record): OK, I merged open PRs - run the next deployment as v1.1.1
Status: DONE — v1.1.1 evaluated GO, tagged, released, deployed by Will, verified live. Exo evaluated @ c5da01ee (#49 footer + #48 warnings + #50 consent CSP all IN, three-way verified; zero open PRs; wiki-anon excluded, named). Tests lib 183/0, bin 81/0, harness 73/0; release build 0 warnings; only failure = documented e2e_local debug-latency (non-blocking). Version bump commit 5939f556; annotated tag v1.1.1 obj 7bf8785c -> 5939f556; GitHub Release live (id 440002502). Will deployed interactively: service restarted clean 06:06:08Z; live footer 'Running build: v1.1.1' 06:06:12Z; strict CSP intact on / and /about; anonymous POST /mcp 401 w/ resource metadata. Consent-page live header not directly observed (needs editor session) — proof chain = tagged-tree served-binary CSP test + regression test + live footer on exact tree. Remaining: Will's fresh Claude connect attempt = first real token exchange expected.
# Preview deployment at preview.phext.io

Coordinate: 41.5.7/7.5.9/7.5.9
Issued: 2026-11-09 07:53 America/Chicago
Request (verbatim): Add a preview deployment for the next edit.phext.io version, pointed at preview.phext.io.
Status: instance built, running and verified on awsbox 2026-11-09 08:02; go-live gated on Will's DNS record + two on-box sudo scripts + provider callbacks

Notes:
- Registered late by Emise (held during the tasks-register repair, restored 08:22).
- Production recon: systemd binary on awsbox, phext-edit.service on 127.0.0.1:8080, env /etc/phext-edit/oauth.env, deploy.sh is single-instance (hardcoded unit/env), box checkout at bf2711b (production already runs the v1.0.0 commit). wbic16 sudo needs a password -> /etc writes are human steps.

Results:
- Preview instance: systemd USER service phext-edit-preview on awsbox, 127.0.0.1:8081, binary built on aletheia-core from exo bf2711b (SHA-256 16e4ced8...), own data snapshot ~/phext-edit-preview/data (98 files, CYOA 831 scrolls), own env ~/.config/phext-edit/preview.env (0600, fresh session secret generated on-box).
- Verified on-box: / 200 (69,342 B — same size as production), /?demo 200, demo API nav/status/tree/search 200, demo POST 405 (read-only), /banner.webp + /background.webp 200 with production-matching hashes, mobile-sheet markers present. Remotely operable via SSH tunnel; 8081 loopback-only from the ranch.
- Production untouched: / + /?demo 200 before (13:55Z) and after (14:01Z); MainPID 1372337 and start 2026-11-09 05:40:47 UTC identical throughout.
- Remaining Will steps, in order: (1) GoDaddy A record host 'preview' -> 44.248.235.76 (preview.phext.io does not resolve yet); (2) on awsbox as a sudo-capable login: ~/preview-nginx/install-preview-env.sh then ~/preview-nginx/install-preview-nginx.sh (bootstrap site -> certbot -> TLS template; env step MUST precede nginx step — until providers are armed the editor runs open, loopback-only exposure); (3) provider consoles: add https://preview.phext.io/api/auth/google/callback (Google) and https://preview.phext.io/api/auth/x/callback (X); GitHub needs a SEPARATE OAuth app (one callback per app) with https://preview.phext.io/api/auth/github/callback, its pair then goes into preview.env (script deliberately leaves GitHub empty until then).
- Docs: PR #38 (emise/preview-deploy-docs, 4d356e7) adds a Preview deployment section to deploy/deploy.md. Record: ~/workspace/preview-deploy-2026-11-09/ (recon-notes.md, installed-configs/). Rollback: systemctl --user disable --now phext-edit-preview + remove unit/env/data (+ root: nginx site files + reload).
