# Slice 7: register allocation state machine

Coordinate: 49.3.6/4.4.12/5.3.10
Issued: 2026-11-07
Request (from session record): continue: register machine
Status: Complete 2026-11-07.

Notes:
- Bounding: shared allocator core in tccgen.c + per-backend register files; occupancy derived from the value stack, never stored (projection states, scroll note N1). x86_64 primary instance, arm64 delta instance (static-only; gfunc_call is an extractor gap in Vol 3, not an event). Meta Secs 14/15 left for sibling Slice 6; Slice 7 claims Secs 16 (register) / 17 (verdict). Parent merges: gate verdict must be regenerated on the merged base, never file-copied.

Results:
- Machine #4 register allocation COMPLETE. x86_64 machine Design 1.1.1/3.2.6/1.1.2: 6 states, 11 events, 26 transitions, 10 invariants. arm64 instance Design 1.1.1/3.2.6/4.1.2: 5 states, 10 events, 16 transitions, 5 invariants. Cross-reference Design 1.1.1/3.2.3/1.1.3.
- Static checker (tools/check_regalloc.py): PASS, 0 violations; event functions resolved 11/11 + 10/10 against Vol 3 def members.
- Dynamic: 8/8 authored trace tests (Tests 1.1.1/5.2.6/1.1.1-8; independent allocator model + ranch phcc == gcc == expectation + objdump emitted-code checks) and 6/6 tests2 corpus.
- Regressions REG6-REG8 at Regressions 1.1.1/6.2.3/1.1.6-8 (Changelog-sourced; Slice 5 spill entries cross-referenced, not duplicated).
- Exit test PASS: seeded store() removal at tccgen.c:1434 (violates I4 save-before-free / HELD --ev_save_reg--> FREE) caught by exactly R02 and R03; corpus collateral 4/6 under the seed.
- Gate v7.0.0: prior sections reproduce byte-identically on base; machine-#4 section static PASS + binding CURRENT; verdict Meta 1.1.1/1.2.10/1.17.1 SHA c2eb1545..., re-run byte-identical.
- Output: ~/workspace/phcc-slice7/phcc.phext SHA-256 6aecde52ce756dd985eb3dcb366896d89f7d9a204f7d3bfda7d8074ca2b0df99 (54,404,295 B, 52,832 scrolls; base scrolls all byte-identical). Report: ~/workspace/phcc-slice7/REPORT.md.
# F3: wire preprocessor phext counters to the phext/ library

Coordinate: 49.5.7/7.6.10/6.5.11
